Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:07.09,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}{\fad(0,100)}人类…人类…人类…人类…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:09.64,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}{\fad(100,100)\3c&H80B219&}可真是个麻烦的生物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:12.45,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}{\fad(100,0)\3c&H80B219&}你说东他说西总唱反调
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:14.99,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}神明大人是否能告诉我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:17.66,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}快开始一堂特别的课程吧
